<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-anas-platyrhynchos-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg within-feather Turing wavelength of Anas platyrhynchos at 378.4 µm (Pass 1) — Code-to-model traceability: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Dispersion, integrator, controls, and the chronoseries ratio (62 * 378.4 µm + 79.2 µm = 23540 µm) are named in the module docstring and in the Lean theorems. The display zoom on the GIF is easy to misread as a change of k_star; the docstring says it is not." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-anas-platyrhynchos-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-anas-platyrhynchos-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-anas-platyrhynchos-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg within-feather Turing wavelength of Anas platyrhynchos at 378.4 µm (Pass 1) — Model fidelity to source: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The Jacobian, classical k_c, fastest-growing k_star, periodic Laplacian, and cubic saturation are the Schnakenberg linearisation, not a cosine pasted in as the field. The quadratic term that selects ocelli is a normal-form addition, and the axial seed chooses orientation. Full far-from-onset Schnakenberg kinetics are not what is integrated." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-anas-platyrhynchos-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-anas-platyrhynchos-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-anas-platyrhynchos-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg within-feather Turing wavelength of Anas platyrhynchos at 378.4 µm (Pass 1) — Morphometric validation: 72/100" ;
